// Title: FortiGate - New VPN SSL Web Portal Added
// ID: 2bfb6216-0c31-4d20-8501-2629b29a3fa2
// Status: experimental
// Level: medium
// Author: Marco Pedrinazzi (@pedrinazziM) (InTheCyber)
// Date: 2025-11-01
// Tags: attack.persistence, attack.initial-access, attack.t1133
// Description: Detects the addition of a VPN SSL Web Portal on a Fortinet FortiGate Firewall.
// This behavior was observed in pair with modification of VPN SSL settings.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

from siem.events where (action == "Add" AND cfgpath == "vpn.ssl.web.portal")
